      "evidence": "Before sharing or changing anything account-specific, the agent must verify the user with their user ID plus either registered email or phone number.\n\nEvent 1: Agent asks for user ID, registered email or phone number.\nEvent 2: Customer provides user ID and registered email.\nEvent 3: verify_user tool confirms the user."
