  "summary": "The customer received a wrong size item for a COD order and requested a bank refund. The agent verified user identity, confirmed the order and policy, explained that COD refunds can only be made to Cartly Wallet, obtained explicit consent, and issued an immediate full refund of ₹448 to the Cartly Wallet without requiring the item return."
